SUMMARY:From Lab to Market: How Can Switzerland Turn World-Class AI Researc
 h into World-Class Companies?
LOCATION:Société de Lecture\, Grand-Rue 11\, Geneva
DESCRIPTION:A panel with the presidents and vice-presidents of EPFL and ETH
  Zurich\, GESDA and Proton on the three things Switzerland needs to turn i
 ts AI research into companies — compute\, capital and data governance 
 — and why the economic value has so far gone elsewhere.\n\nOrganiser: Ge
 neva Center for Neutrality\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdatae
 vents.ch/events/from-lab-to-market-geneva-2026/
